<font color=#ffff00>Thu May 17th, 2001 9:01pm</font></font></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#ddddff><td><ul><font size=1 face=verdana>It has come to my attention that there are several new guild members that have not been added to the guild list. Every time I get on in the last 2 weeks there have been at least 1 person who is not listed. At one time I started a list and it reached at least 10 members, who are not listed. Officers need to add each new member as they invite them. As an officer this is your duty.Also if you are a listed member then update your characters as related to levels or characters who may not even be guilded anymore. Some of the members are not even \\\"alive\\\" any more. If this is the case, email Jiggs at kalxen@roleplayers.org and they will be deleted. I would really like to see this member list kept as up to date as possible. Thanks All!
</font></ul></td></tr></table><table cellpadding=2 cellspacing=1 border=0 width=100%><tr bgcolor=#336699><td><font size=2 face=verdana
