color=gold><b>Welcome to the Site</b></font> - <font size=1 face=verdana
color=white><a href=/showmember.php?name=Jiggles>Jiggles</a> on
<font color=#ffff00>Thu January 18th, 2001 1:12am</font></font></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#ddddff><td><ul><font size=1 face=verdana>Hey all, I swear someone has to help me level now.  I've been putting in most of my nights since last Friday working on this website, and building everything you see.  Eldaronmyth created all the graphics and contributed to coming up with what areas we need here.   Please take your time to explore everything, suggest new items or things to fix in the forums, etc.<p>There are many areas to enjoy (available only to Guild Members)<ul><li><b>Character Update</b> - Here you can update items on your character, let others know your lvl and where you are in trade skills.  We will hopefully add some more things in here, like items you have to contribute to the guild treasury, etc.</li><li><b>Member List</b> - This area is dynamicly created by the database, like most of this site.  You can see who is in the guild, and who are masters in trade skills.</li><li><b>Calendar of Events</b> - Still some work to do here, but we will have a calendar where you can find up to date information on upcoming and past events, etc.</li><li><b>Screenshots</b> - Share your explorations!  Anyone can view this area, but only guild members can upload their own screenshots.</li></ul><p>In the future, I hope to add a chat server, instant messaging, or other kewl little ideas that you may come up with.  Anyhow, I hope everyone enjoys the new website.  This is hosted on my own server/domain so it should be here to stay so long as I am a computer geek.<p>See ya all on EQ,   -Jiggles
</font></ul></td></tr></table></td></tr>
